```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Email Verification - SH Healthcare System</title>
  </head>

  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f8fc;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #172033;
    "
  >
    <table
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      border="0"
      style="background-color: #f5f8fc; padding: 48px 16px;"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">

          <!-- Main Card -->
          <table
            width="100%"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            border="0"
            style="
              max-width: 580px;
              background-color: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 18px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
            "
          >

            <!-- Brand Header -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 28px 34px;
                  border-bottom: 1px solid #eef2f7;
                "
              >
                <table
                  width="100%"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  border="0"
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      <div
                        style="
                          display: inline-block;
                          width: 38px;
                          height: 38px;
                          line-height: 38px;
                          text-align: center;
                          background-color: #2563eb;
                          color: #ffffff;
                          border-radius: 10px;
                          font-size: 18px;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          vertical-align: middle;
                        "
                      >
                        SH
                      </div>

                      <span
                        style="
                          margin-left: 10px;
                          color: #172033;
                          font-size: 17px;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          vertical-align: middle;
                        "
                      >
                        SH Healthcare System
                      </span>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Content -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 42px 38px 38px;">

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 12px;
                    color: #64748b;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
                  "
                >
                  ACCOUNT SECURITY
                </p>

                <h1
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 16px;
                    color: #111827;
                    font-size: 28px;
                    line-height: 1.25;
                    font-weight: 700;
                  "
                >
                  Verify your account
                </h1>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 10px;
                    color: #334155;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.7;
                  "
                >
                  Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 28px;
                    color: #64748b;
                    font-size: 15px;
                    line-height: 1.75;
                  "
                >
                  We received a request to email verification associated
                  with your SH Healthcare System account. Enter the
                  verification code below to continue.
                </p>

                <!-- OTP -->
                <table
                  width="100%"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  border="0"
                  style="
                    background-color: #f8faff;
                    border: 1px solid #dbeafe;
                    border-radius: 14px;
                  "
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding: 25px 20px;">

                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0 0 12px;
                          color: #64748b;
                          font-size: 12px;
                          font-weight: 600;
                          letter-spacing: 1.2px;
                          text-transform: uppercase;
                        "
                      >
                        Verification Code
                      </p>

                      <div
                        style="
                          color: #1d4ed8;
                          font-size: 34px;
                          line-height: 1;
                          font-weight: 700;
                          letter-spacing: 8px;
                          padding-left: 8px;
                        "
                      >
                        <%= OTP %>
                      </div>

                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

                <!-- Expiration -->
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 16px 0 28px;
                    color: #64748b;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    text-align: center;
                  "
                >
                  This verification code expires in
                  <strong style="color: #334155;">
                    <%= expirationMinutes %> minutes
                  </strong>.
                </p>

                <!-- Security Note -->
                <table
                  width="100%"
                  cellpadding="0"
                  cellspacing="0"
                  border="0"
                  style="
                    border-top: 1px solid #eef2f7;
                  "
                >
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding-top: 24px;">

                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0 0 8px;
                          color: #334155;
                          font-size: 13px;
                          font-weight: 600;
                        "
                      >
                        Security notice
                      </p>

                      <p
                        style="
                          margin: 0;
                          color: #64748b;
                          font-size: 13px;
                          line-height: 1.7;
                        "
                      >
                        Please do not share this verification
                        code with anyone.
                      </p>

                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>

              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td
                style="
                  padding: 24px 38px;
                  background-color: #fafbfc;
                  border-top: 1px solid #eef2f7;
                "
              >
                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0 0 6px;
                    color: #475569;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  "
                >
                  SH Healthcare System
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 0;
                    color: #94a3b8;
                    font-size: 11px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                  "
                >
                  This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this
                  email.
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    margin: 10px 0 0;
                    color: #94a3b8;
                    font-size: 11px;
                  "
                >
                  © 2026 SH Healthcare System. All rights reserved.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>

        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
```
